OL,3,GNEWSAGas work 'unrecognisable' to
OL,4,Aindustry standard
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork done on gas pipes was
OL,7,F"unrecognisable" when compared to
OL,8,Findustry standards, a court has heard.
OL,10,FA health and safety case against gas
OL,11,Fcompany Island Energy (IE), represented
OL,12,Fby chief executive Graeme Millar, is
OL,13,Fbeing heard over the deaths of 10
OL,14,Fresidents at the Haut du Mont flats in
OL,15,FSt Helier following the blast on 10
OL,16,FDecember 2022.
OL,18,FGas workers Lee Ward, 59, Neil
OL,19,FArmstrong, 58, and John Wright, 60,
OL,20,Fhave also each pleaded not guilty to 10
OL,21,Fcounts of gross negligence
OL,22,Fmanslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
