OL,3,GNEWSAGas work 'unrecognisable' to
OL,4,Aindustry standard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury was shown a video of gas
OL,7,Fengineers demonstrating how the work
OL,8,Fshould have been carried out on the day
OL,9,Fbefore the explosion, including capping
OL,10,Foff a main pipe and a pressure test
OL,11,Fbeing mentioned.
